---
const heroImg = "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Chateau_de_Montsegur.jpg/1280px-Chateau_de_Montsegur.jpg";
const forestBg = "https://runesdechene.com/cdn/shop/files/fond_newsletter_49315af4-ed7c-4592-8da4-8453b9b08ea7.webp";
const iconArbre = "https://runesdechene.com/cdn/shop/files/rdc_icon-arbre.png";
const iconRune = "https://runesdechene.com/cdn/shop/files/rdc_icon-rune.png";
const logoMarron = "https://runesdechene.com/cdn/shop/files/LOGO_ligne_marron.webp";
const nearby1 = "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/Grotte_du_Mas_d%27Azil.jpg/800px-Grotte_du_Mas_d%27Azil.jpg";
const nearby2 = "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Foix_Chateau_02.jpg/800px-Foix_Chateau_02.jpg";
const nearby3 = "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Dolmen_de_Sem.jpg/800px-Dolmen_de_Sem.jpg";
const nearby4 = "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Cascade_d%27Ars.jpg/800px-Cascade_d%27Ars.jpg";
---

<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Propositions Design — SEO Lieux</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Cabin+Condensed:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Cabin:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    /* ===================== SELECTOR ===================== */
    .selector {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 9999;
      background: rgba(30,28,24,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0;
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed', sans-serif;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    .selector a {
      padding: 1.1rem 3rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.82rem; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .selector a:hover { color: #f2c873; border-bottom-color: #f2c873; }

    .divider {
      padding: 5rem 2rem; text-align: center;
      background: #1e1c18; color: #fff;
    }
    .divider h2 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #f2c873; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .divider p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); font-family: 'Cabin', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; }

    /* ===================================================
       A — EXPEDITION EDITORIALE
       =================================================== */
    .a { background: #f4eee1; color: #594848; font-family: 'Cabin', sans-serif; }

    .a-head {
      padding: 1rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d4c8b4;
    }
    .a-head img { height: 28px; }
    .a-head nav { display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
    .a-head nav a {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #7d6b6b; text-decoration: none;
    }
    .a-head .cta {
      background: #833434; color: #f6eddd !important; padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .a-hero { position: relative; height: 80vh; overflow: hidden; }
    .a-hero img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .a-hero-grad { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, rgba(89,72,72,0.92)); }
    .a-hero-c {
      position: absolute; bottom: 4rem; left: 4rem; right: 4rem; z-index: 2;
    }
    .a-hero-c .type {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: #f2c873; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .a-hero-c h1 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue'; font-size: 6rem; line-height: 0.9; color: #f4eee1;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .a-hero-c .loc { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(244,238,225,0.55); }

    .a-content { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 5rem 2rem; }

    .a-desc {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }
    .a-desc::first-letter {
      font-size: 5rem; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; float: left;
      line-height: 0.72; margin-right: 0.12em; margin-top: 0.06em; color: #833434;
    }

    .a-label {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: #C19A6B;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem;
    }
    .a-label::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: #d4c8b4; }

    .a-rc { padding: 2rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,200,180,0.35); }
    .a-rc:last-of-type { border: none; }
    .a-rc-h { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .a-rc-h .name {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .a-rc-h .votes { font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #C19A6B; }
    .a-rc p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #7d6b6b; font-style: italic; }
    .a-rc p::before { content: '« '; color: #C19A6B; font-style: normal; }
    .a-rc p::after { content: ' »'; color: #C19A6B; font-style: normal; }

    .a-cta-wrap {
      background: url("${forestBg}") center/cover; position: relative;
      margin: 4rem -2rem; padding: 6rem 2rem; text-align: center;
    }
    .a-cta-wrap::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(70,73,60,0.88);
    }
    .a-cta-wrap > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .a-cta-wrap img { width: 45px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; opacity: 0.7; }
    .a-cta-wrap h2 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue'; font-size: 3.5rem; color: #f6eddd; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .a-cta-wrap p { color: rgba(246,237,221,0.5); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .a-cta-wrap .btn {
      display: inline-block; background: #f2c873; color: #46493c; padding: 1rem 3rem;
      border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.88rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .a-nearby { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin: 4rem 0; }
    .a-nearby a {
      text-decoration: none; color: inherit; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;
      background: #ede4d3; transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .a-nearby a:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .a-nearby img { width: 100%; height: 140px; object-fit: cover; }
    .a-nearby .info { padding: 1rem; }
    .a-nearby .t {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #C19A6B; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }
    .a-nearby .n { font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; }

    /* ===================================================
       B — GRIMOIRE NOCTURNE
       =================================================== */
    .b { background: #141310; color: #c8bc9e; font-family: 'Cabin', sans-serif; }

    .b-head {
      padding: 1rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,188,158,0.08);
    }
    .b-head .brand {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue'; font-size: 1.3rem; color: #f2c873;
      text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }
    .b-head nav { display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
    .b-head nav a {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgba(200,188,158,0.35); text-decoration: none;
    }
    .b-head .cta {
      border: 1px solid rgba(242,200,115,0.25) !important; color: #f2c873 !important;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(242,200,115,0.06) !important;
    }

    .b-hero { position: relative; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
    .b-hero img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: brightness(0.35) saturate(0.7); }
    .b-hero-grad {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(transparent 40%, rgba(20,19,16,1) 100%);
    }
    .b-hero-c {
      position: absolute; bottom: 8rem; left: 0; right: 0; text-align: center; z-index: 2;
    }
    .b-hero-c .orn { width: 50px; height: 1px; background: #f2c873; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }
    .b-hero-c .type {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4em; color: #f2c873; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .b-hero-c h1 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 5rem; line-height: 1.05;
      color: rgba(246,237,221,0.9); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .b-hero-c .loc { font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(200,188,158,0.35); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

    .b-content { max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 5rem 2rem; }

    .b-desc {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 2.2;
      color: rgba(200,188,158,0.75); text-align: justify;
    }
    .b-orn { width: 60px; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #f2c873, transparent); margin: 4rem auto; }

    .b-label {
      text-align: center; font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4em; color: rgba(242,200,115,0.35); margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .b-rc { padding: 2.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,188,158,0.06); }
    .b-rc:last-of-type { border: none; }
    .b-rc .name {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: rgba(242,200,115,0.6); margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .b-rc p {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 2;
      color: rgba(200,188,158,0.5); font-style: italic;
    }

    .b-cta {
      text-align: center; padding: 6rem 2rem;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(242,200,115,0.03) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }
    .b-cta h2 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 2.8rem;
      color: rgba(246,237,221,0.85); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .b-cta p { color: rgba(200,188,158,0.3); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .b-cta .btn {
      display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #f2c873; color: #f2c873; padding: 1rem 3.5rem;
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .b-cta .btn:hover { background: #f2c873; color: #141310; }

    .b-nearby {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem;
      max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem 5rem;
    }
    .b-nearby a {
      text-decoration: none; color: inherit; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,188,158,0.08); transition: border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .b-nearby a:hover { border-color: rgba(242,200,115,0.25); }
    .b-nearby img { width: 100%; height: 120px; object-fit: cover; filter: brightness(0.6) saturate(0.6); }
    .b-nearby .info { padding: 1rem; }
    .b-nearby .t {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.58rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: rgba(242,200,115,0.3); margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }
    .b-nearby .n { font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: #c8bc9e; }

    /* ===================================================
       C — CONTRE L'OUBLI (Inspiré site boutique)
       =================================================== */
    .c { background: #fff; color: #2c2724; font-family: 'Cabin', sans-serif; }

    .c-head {
      padding: 1rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eae3d7;
    }
    .c-head img { height: 28px; }
    .c-head nav { display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
    .c-head nav a {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #8a7e6b; text-decoration: none;
    }
    .c-head .cta {
      background: #833434 !important; color: #fff !important; padding: 0.55rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.75rem !important;
    }

    .c-hero { position: relative; height: 75vh; overflow: hidden; }
    .c-hero img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .c-hero-grad { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(transparent 40%, rgba(44,39,36,0.9)); }
    .c-hero-c { position: absolute; bottom: 4rem; left: 4rem; right: 4rem; z-index: 2; }
    .c-hero-c .type {
      display: inline-block; background: #833434; color: #fff; padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 100px; font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .c-hero-c h1 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue'; font-size: 5.5rem; line-height: 0.92; color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .c-hero-c .loc { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

    .c-values {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eae3d7;
    }
    .c-values div {
      padding: 2rem; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid #eae3d7;
    }
    .c-values div:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .c-values img { width: 36px; margin: 0 auto 0.8rem; opacity: 0.7; }
    .c-values span {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #8a7e6b;
    }

    .c-content { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; }

    .c-desc { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.9; color: #4a4540; margin-bottom: 4rem; }

    .c-section-h {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue'; font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: #2c2724; margin-bottom: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #833434; display: inline-block;
    }

    .c-cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
    .c-card {
      background: #f9f5ee; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem;
      border-left: 4px solid #833434;
    }
    .c-card-h { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .c-card-h .name { font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
    .c-card-h .votes {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #833434; font-weight: 700;
      background: rgba(131,52,52,0.08); padding: 0.15rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 100px;
    }
    .c-card p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #6b6460; }

    .c-cta-wrap {
      background: url("${forestBg}") center/cover; position: relative;
      padding: 6rem 2rem; text-align: center;
    }
    .c-cta-wrap::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(44,39,36,0.85); }
    .c-cta-wrap > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .c-cta-wrap h2 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue'; font-size: 3.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .c-cta-wrap p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; max-width: 450px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .c-cta-wrap .btn {
      display: inline-block; background: #833434; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 3rem;
      border-radius: 100px; font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.88rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-decoration: none;
    }

    .c-nearby { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; margin: 4rem 0; }
    .c-nearby a {
      text-decoration: none; color: inherit; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
      background: #f9f5ee; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .c-nearby a:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .c-nearby img { width: 100%; height: 150px; object-fit: cover; }
    .c-nearby .info { padding: 1.2rem; }
    .c-nearby .t {
      font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: #833434; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }
    .c-nearby .n { font-family: 'Cabin Condensed'; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="selector">
  <a href="#pa">A — L'Expédition</a>
  <a href="#pb">B — Le Grimoire</a>
  <a href="#pc">C — Contre l'Oubli</a>
</nav>

<!-- ==================== A ==================== -->
<div class="divider" id="pa" style="padding-top: 6rem;">
  <h2>Proposition A — L'Expédition</h2>
  <p>Parchemin chaud, lettrine rouge-brun, journal d'explorateur. Inspiré du fond app.</p>
</div>

<div class="a">
  <header class="a-head">
    <img src={logoMarron} alt="Runes de Chêne" />
    <nav>
      <a href="#">La Carte</a>
      <a href="#">Boutique</a>
      <a href="#" class="cta">Télécharger l'app</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="a-hero">
    <img src={heroImg} alt="Montségur" />
    <div class="a-hero-grad"></div>
    <div class="a-hero-c">
      <p class="type">Château</p>
      <h1>Château de<br/>Montségur</h1>
      <p class="loc">09300 Montségur, Ariège, Occitanie</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="a-content">
    <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #d4c8b4;">
      <p class="a-desc">Perché à 1207 mètres d'altitude sur un piton rocheux des Pyrénées ariégeoises, le château de Montségur est l'un des sites cathares les plus emblématiques de France. Cette forteresse médiévale, reconstruite entre 1204 et 1211, fut le dernier bastion de la résistance cathare avant le siège de 1243-1244 qui s'acheva par le bûcher de plus de 200 parfaits. Les vestiges actuels offrent un panorama vertigineux sur les vallées environnantes.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="padding: 3rem 0;">
      <div class="a-label">Récits des explorateurs</div>
      <div class="a-rc">
        <div class="a-rc-h"><span class="name">Rémy</span><span class="votes">▲ 14</span></div>
        <p>Lieu absolument magique. L'ascension est rude mais la vue au sommet est à couper le souffle. On ressent vraiment le poids de l'histoire en se tenant sur ces ruines. Les cathares ont défendu ces murs jusqu'au bout. Émouvant.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a-rc">
        <div class="a-rc-h"><span class="name">Léa</span><span class="votes">▲ 8</span></div>
        <p>Montée sportive d'environ 40 minutes. Arrivez tôt le matin pour éviter la foule et profiter de la brume qui enveloppe les ruines. Sensation d'être hors du temps.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="a-cta-wrap">
      <img src={iconRune} alt="" />
      <h2>Explorez Montségur</h2>
      <p>Rejoignez les explorateurs qui documentent le patrimoine. Gratuite, sans pub.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn">Découvrir sur l'app</a>
    </section>

    <section style="padding: 3rem 0;">
      <div class="a-label">Lieux à proximité</div>
      <div class="a-nearby">
        <a href="#"><img src={nearby1} alt="Mas d'Azil" /><div class="info"><p class="t">Grotte</p><p class="n">Grotte du Mas-d'Azil</p></div></a>
        <a href="#"><img src={nearby2} alt="Foix" /><div class="info"><p class="t">Château</p><p class="n">Château de Foix</p></div></a>
        <a href="#"><img src={nearby3} alt="Dolmen" /><div class="info"><p class="t">Dolmen</p><p class="n">Dolmen de Sem</p></div></a>
        <a href="#"><img src={nearby4} alt="Cascade" /><div class="info"><p class="t">Cascade</p><p class="n">Cascade d'Ars</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ==================== B ==================== -->
<div class="divider" id="pb">
  <h2>Proposition B — Le Grimoire</h2>
  <p>Sombre et mystique. Or sur nuit. Italique serif. Le parchemin vu à la bougie.</p>
</div>

<div class="b">
  <header class="b-head">
    <a class="brand" href="#">RUNES DE CHÊNE</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">La Carte</a>
      <a href="#">Boutique</a>
